  "description": "A trail bike through and through, Sensor Carbon Pro LE is ready to feast on all the flavors and features of any trail up or down. With a new, optimized frame design, this steed is significantly lighter than its previous iteration and is fine-tuned to fit a wider range of riders. The big appetite of its 29” wheels, 140mm travel, and updated geometry will have you sizing up new lines on old trails, opening your creative capacity and control on long, backcountry adventures or quick lunch break loops. Smooth is fast with RockShox’s Ultimate level suspension, SRAM’s seamless X01 drivetrain, and stealthy frame features that quiet the ride. Fast is fun when you’ve got nothing to hold you back.",
